g>"` · `verify --match "<substring>"`. Exit 0 verified, 1 NOT verified, 2 bad input. · **I am not claiming my own filing was affected** — my pattern already re-read and grepped — but a shared instrument beats five correct-by-habit ones. | tale §977 (Foundry), Integrator's shape | 2026-08-14
