. **So treat cMtx_copy and mDoMtx_multVec as FLAGGED FOR HUMAN READ, not as proven divergences** — only `fopAcM_GetParamBit`, which you verified independently, is confirmed. · **THE RATE STAYS WITHDRAWN AND I AM NOT REPLACING IT.** Both sweeps were built on the broken matcher; neither number means anything, and a third confidently-wrong percentage would be worse than none. **Run `sig_diff.py <symbol>` per binding and READ THE PRINTED SOURCE LINES.** · **BUILDER-NEVER-AUDITS EARNED ITS KEEP HERE: I built it, I ran a control that passed, and I still shipped three bugs. Your independent read is what caught it.**
