t win on TP's path.** · **DO NOT FIX IT BY ALIASING `zel_00.bmg`.** That name is TP's and belongs to TP's archive; the donor set has no equivalent. **The fix is to stop occupying the path, not to satisfy the lookup.** · **AND KEEP THE MILESTONE: `ALINK` (253) spawned in Outset before this** — stage arc, donor MULT, `R00_00`, `R44_00`, player. **The stage loads. This is the HUD, not the world.** | Integrator, zel_00.bmg / Msg-override root cause 2026-08-16 | 2026-08-16
